          "prst": null,
          "flipH": null,
          "flipV": null,
          "text": "Left-Brain Characteristics"
        },
        {
          "type": "sp",
          "id": 3,
          "name": "Content Placeholder 2",
          "x": 457200,
          "y": 1870075,
          "cx": 4040188,
          "cy": 4256088,
          "prst": null,
          "flipH": null,
          "flipV": null,
          "text": "Helps us manipulate the worldClinical attentionLeft hemisphere sees isolated details that areFamiliarKnownFixedGraspableAbstractedTaken out of contextCategorizableGeneral in natureGenerally inanimate, because the process has completely isolated them from everything else and deanimated themGrasping a tiny detailNarrowly, focused, targeted attention to something it already knows about"
        },
        {
          "type": "sp",
          "id": 7,
          "name": "Text Placeholder 6",
          "x": 4645025,
          "y": 1230313,
          "cx": 4041775,
          "cy": 639762,
          "prst": null,
          "flipH": null,
          "flipV": null,
          "text": "Right-Brain Characteristics"
        },
        {
          "type": "sp",
          "id": 8,
          "name": "Content Placeholder 7",
          "x": 4645025,
          "y": 1870075,
          "cx": 4041775,
          "cy": 4256088,
          "prst": null,
          "flipH": null,
          "flipV": null,
          "text": "Helps us understand the worldRapt attentionRight hemisphere\u2019s vision sees things that areonly partly knownonly partly certain of what we are looking atFreshInterconnected, and situated where they are in contextWhen we take them out of context, they change their natureFlowing and changing, not fixed and graspable in a simple wayUnique rather than exemplars of a common themeEmbodied rather than abstracted and disembodiedAnimate, rather than inanimateHas the ability to look out for something we might be missing -- more skepticalAssembles facts for application in an embodied world."
        },
        {
          "type": "sp",
          "id": 4,
