          "text": "Developing the Right-Brain"
        },
        {
          "type": "sp",
          "id": 10,
          "name": "Content Placeholder 9",
          "x": 457200,
          "y": 1600200,
          "cx": 8229600,
          "cy": 4756150,
          "prst": null,
          "flipH": null,
          "flipV": null,
          "text": "If we want to educate students to be world-class scientists, we need to develop and not dismiss right-brain thinkingBoth left and right-brain thinking are critical for breakthrough scienceTeach an understanding of and appreciation for Music, Art, and the SacredFor example: band, drawing, family, and the pledge of allegiance/reveilleThe Saint Luke Guild was founded to bring high quality, physical reproductions of the greatest works of art to students of average meansEnabled by two technological developments from the last 20 yearsThe explosion of high-resolution, digital imagery of the greatest works of art, previously reserved to museum visitorsThe dramatic improvements in low-cost, museum quality photographic printing methods"
